title: Aruba Central: Access Point CPU Utilization
agents: linux, windows
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 CPU utilization of an Aruba access point as reported by Aruba Central.
 The default levels are 80%/90% and can be changed with the rule "Aruba
 access point CPU utilization".

perfdata:
 One value: the CPU utilization in percent.

inventory:
 One service per access point that reports a CPU value.
